<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 0.9 pct in July 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 0.9 pct in July 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices fell 0.9 percent in the July 1-10 period after falling 1.4 percent in the previous 10 days, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>Food prices were 3.8-percent lower between July 1-10 than in the June 1-10 period.  </p>
<p>				  JULY 1-10   JUNE 21-30   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -0.9	  -1.4	 -3.8 (1.5)</p>
<p> Bread			     -0.2	   0.1	  0.3 (0.2)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -6.9	  -9.1	-23.4 (11.6)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.3	   0.1	  0.5 (0.1)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.3	   0.2	  0.7 (0.7)</p>
<p> Eggs				-2.1	  -1.7	 -5.6 (-6.8)</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in brackets are for the previous 30-day period ending on June 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
